    "architecturalFinding": "Verified fixed (issue #51): DefaultPluginSecurityValidator.ValidateAssemblyAsync is metadata-only (PEReader \u002B MetadataReader) and no longer loads the plugin file into any AssemblyLoadContext during validation, so plugin assemblies load only into the collectible PluginLoadContext and UnloadAllPlugins actually unloads them. Pre-fix behavior (Assembly.LoadFrom pinning in the DEFAULT ALC, loader reuse of the pinned copy, UnloadAllPlugins a no-op for in-use assemblies) is documented by the committed data/20261116_sandbox and data/20261123_sandbox runs.",
    "verdictScope": "plugin implementation assemblies (the collectible ALC path); the shared plugin interface assembly (PluginImplementations.dll) intentionally resides in the default context in all phases",
    "hybridExecutionNote": "Containerized-seam executions use an in-memory orchestrator (CRPCF dispatch path only, no container); a real container backend adds its own lifecycle that this measurement does not cover"
